    Dated log     Upload classicalbts_log_collector.sh in gNB
    SSH Upload Script           alias=${Myalias}        localPath=${CURDIR}/../scripts
    ...                         scriptFile=classicalbts_log_collector.sh      remotePath=/ffs/run/config/scripts

