Install classicalbts log collector into Airphone
    Run Keyword And Ignore Error    OperatingSystem.File Should Exist    {CURDIR}/../scripts/classicalbts_log_collector.sh
    ${Myalias}                        SSH Wait For Connect                    ${AP_DU.sys[0].M}
